<title>ITALY: SOCCER-JUVENTUS BEAT PARIS ST GERMAIN 3-1 IN SUPERCUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-JUVENTUS BEAT PARIS ST GERMAIN 3-1 IN SUPERCUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>PALERMO, Sicily 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the European</p>
<p>Supercup final, second leg played on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Juventus (Italy) 3  Paris St Germain (France) 1 (HT: 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Juventus - Alessandro Del Piero 36 and 70, Christian Vieri</p>
<p>90</p>
<p>PSG - Rai, penalty 64</p>
<p>Attendance: 35,100</p>
<p>Juventus win 9-2 on aggregate.</p>
</text>
